  "answer_text": "With the early summer price wars kicking off and Amazon Prime Day around the corner, major retailers like Amazon and Best Buy are dropping deep discounts on laptops. \n\nThe best online laptop deals are categorized below by budget, productivity, and gaming to help you find the right fit.\n\n---\n\n### **1. Top Productivity & Everyday Deals**\n\n*   **Apple MacBook Air 15-inch (M5)** \n    *   **Deal Price:** **$1,149** (was $1,299 \u2014 Save $150)\n    *   **Where to buy:** Best Buy / Amazon\n    *   **Key Specs:** Apple M5 chip, 16GB unified memory, 512GB SSD. \n    *   **Why it's a great buy:** This is a rare, early discount on Apple\u2019s newest 15-inch M5 model. It delivers incredible speed and all-day battery life, making it perfect for students and professionals who prefer a larger screen.\n*   **Apple MacBook Air 13-inch (M4 \u2014 2025 Model)**\n    *   **Deal Price:** **$1,099** (was $1,399 \u2014 Save $300)\n    *   **Where to buy:** Best Buy\n    *   **Key Specs:** Apple M4 chip, 24GB unified memory, 512GB SSD.\n    *   **Why it's a great buy:** If you want a portable Mac, this 13-inch M4 configuration offers an incredible **24GB of RAM**, making it highly future-proof for heavy multitasking and local AI tasks at a massive discount.\n*   **Lenovo ThinkPad E16 (Gen 3)**\n    *   **Deal Price:** **$1,289** (was $1,799 \u2014 Save $510)\n    *   **Where to buy:** Amazon\n    *   **Key Specs:** Large screen, highly durable keyboard, excellent business features.\n    *   **Why it's a great buy:** This is a steep $510 discount on an ultra-reliable workhorse known for its build quality and enterprise security. \n*   **Asus Vivobook 16**\n    *   **Deal Price:** **$699** (was $799 \u2014 Save $100)\n    *   **Where to buy:** Amazon\n    *   **Why it's a great buy:** A fantastic, wallet-friendly 16-inch daily driver with plenty of screen real estate for home use or school.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Best Budget Deals**\n\n*   **Acer Aspire Lite 15**\n 